Depends: plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7), plasma-desktop-data, qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-workspace, qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-plasma5support
Recommends: uzunyx-timer
Description: Clock for the Plasma panel, in the Uzunyx style
 Plasma widget (org.uzunyx.clock): the time in large figures with the minutes
 in the edition's accent colour and the date below, without a box. Clicking it
 opens Plasma's calendar.
